# Salesforce

## Create Classes
sf apex generate class --output-dir force-app/main/default/classes --name <ClassName>

sf apex generate class --output-dir force-app/main/default/classes --template ApexUnitTest --name <ClassNameTest>

sf lightning generate component --type lwc --output-dir force-app/main/default/lwc --name <YourComponentName>

## Authentication
### Find hte Auth URL
sf org display --verbose --target-org <alias>
